    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Swiss Knife for Woo provides a lot of small utility functionalities that are needed by most of the WooCommerce stores.<br />\nSo instead of installing a lot of plugins, just install Swiss Knife of Woo. It has a smart Module Manager that allows you to enable only the modules that you need. So much less strain on your server.</p>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Repeater Order</li>\n<li>Cancel Order</li>\n<li>Add To Cart Text</li>\n<li>Change Related Product Heading</li>\n<li>Countdown</li>\n<li>Stock Progress Bar</li>\n<li>Price Saving</li>\n<li>Coupon Checkbox<br />\nMany more coming soon&#8230;</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin files to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/plugin-name</code> directory, or install the plugin through the WordPress plugins screen directly.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; screen in WordPress</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>0.1</h4>\n<p>Initial Release</p>\n<h4>0.2</h4>\n<p>Fixed settings page code conflicting with other Woo Addons.</p>\n<h4>0.3</h4>\n<p>Added <strong>Add To Cart Text</strong> module<br />\nAdded <strong>Change Related Product Heading</strong> module</p>\n<h4>0.4</h4>\n<p>Added <strong>Countdown</strong> module<br />\nAdded <strong>Stock Progress Bar</strong> module</p>\n<h4>0.5</h4>\n<p>Added <strong>Price Saving</strong> module<br />\nAdded <strong>Coupon Checkbox</strong> module</p>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Ultimate utility tools for your WooCommerce Stores.",
    "description": "<p>Swiss Knife for Woo provides a lot of small utility functionalities that are needed by most of the WooCommerce stores.<br />\nSo instead of installing a lot of plugins, just install Swiss Knife of Woo. It has a smart Module Manager that allows you to enable only the modules that you need. So much less strain on your server.</p>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Repeater Order</li>\n<li>Cancel Order</li>\n<li>Add To Cart Text</li>\n<li>Change Related Product Heading</li>\n<li>Countdown</li>\n<li>Stock Progress Bar</li>\n<li>Price Saving</li>\n<li>Coupon Checkbox<br />\nMany more coming soon&#8230;</li>\n</ol>\n",
